# NOTICE

This project is based on [lox](https://github.com/discostu105/lox) by
**Christoph Neumüller** ([@discostu105](https://github.com/discostu105)),
originally licensed under GPL-3.0.

The original project provides a Loxone Miniserver CLI for controlling lights,
blinds, and more from the terminal. This fork extends it with config-as-code
editing, an offline SPS simulator, and AI agent tooling.

