Major additions in this fork:
- Config editing engine (`src/config_edit/`) — DOM-based XML editing
- SPS simulator (`lox-sim/`) — offline circuit testing for 195 block types
- Block library (`lox blocks`) — search and introspect 190+ block types
- Eval harness (`tests/eval/`) — 285 behavioral test cases
- AI agent skill references (`.github/skills/`)
- LoxCC compression (`src/loxcc.rs`)
- GitOps versioning (`src/gitops.rs`)

Files substantially derived from the original project:
- `src/main.rs` — CLI entry point and command dispatch
- `src/client.rs` — Loxone HTTP client
- `src/config.rs` — Configuration loading
- `src/token.rs` — Token authentication
- `src/ws.rs` — WebSocket client
- `src/ftp.rs` — FTP operations
